    "text_EjALGx": {
      "type": "text",
      "custom_css": [],
      "name": "Rich text",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "About this downtown Provo venue",
        "content": "<p>Thread’s 241 Event Space is a 2,220 sq ft industrial venue in downtown Provo, Utah, at 241 W Center Street. Built over a century ago, the historic red-brick building is a flexible setting for weddings, receptions, corporate events, workshops, nonprofit gatherings, and graduation parties in Utah County.</p><p>The space includes a full kitchen, a stage with jumbotron, a professional sound system, tables and chairs, a rolling bar, on-site parking, and an ADA-accessible layout for 100–150 guests. Whether you are planning a wedding in Provo or a community event on Center Street, the venue can be customized to fit your day.</p><p>If you have any questions please email teagan@threadwallets.com or call (720) 883-8031</p>",
        "button_label": "Book a tour",
        "button_url": "https://calendly.com/teagan-threadwallets/30min",
        "spacing_top": 60,
        "spacing_bottom": 60,
        "color_scheme": "color__bg-body color__text",
        "color_border": "color__border-divider-1",
        "color_button": "btn",
        "style_border": "",
        "layout_x_alignment": "text-center justify-center",
        "content_x_alignment": "text-left",
        "visibility": ""
      }
    },
