    "accordions_wQpc46": {
      "type": "accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "content_location": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where is 241 Event Space located?",
            "content": "<p>241 Event Space is in downtown Provo, Utah at 241 W Center Street, 84601, inside Thread HQ. The venue sits on Center Street with 20+ on-site parking spots, plus nearby street parking and a public garage.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_event_types": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What types of events can I host in Provo?",
            "content": "<p>The venue hosts weddings, receptions, corporate events, workshops, nonprofit gatherings, networking events, and graduation parties in Provo and Utah County. Community events start at $50/hour, and private celebrations have weekday and weekend rates.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_GtUYdT": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "When is payment due?",
            "content": "<p>The date of your event will be booked and reserved for you as soon as you have paid the $100 security deposit. The rest of the payment is due 1 week prior to your event. Access to the venue will not be granted until payment is received.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_xfJHrk": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you allow alcohol?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Alcohol is permitted with the required $300 alcohol fee and the use of a licensed bartender. Clients may hire any licensed bartender of their choice.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_GKB4Mk": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What are your venue policies?",
            "content": "<p>To ensure the safety and care of our venue, we ask all clients to review and adhere to the<br/>following policies. Violation of any policy may result in forfeiture of the security deposit.</p><ul><li>Prohibited Items & Activities:</li><li>Candles or open flames of any kind</li><li>Illegal substances</li><li>Confetti, petals, rice, lavender, glitter, or similar small loose items (throwing or<br/>scattering is not permitted)</li><li>Cleaning Fee & Closing Checklist</li><li>A $50 cleaning fee is required for all events. </li></ul><p>This covers standard post-event<br/>cleaning. Clients are responsible for completing the closing checklist provided at<br/>the event. Failure to complete checklist items may result in loss of deposit.<br/>-Alcohol Policy<br/>-Events serving alcohol must pay a $300 alcohol fee.<br/>-A licensed bartender is required and must be present while alcohol is served.<br/>Failure to pay the alcohol fee or provide a licensed bartender will result in loss of<br/>deposit.<br/>-Damages & Property Loss<br/>-Any damage to the venue or its contents will result in loss of deposit. This<br/>includes but is not limited to holes or dents in walls, nails, tape, command strips,<br/>peeled paint, or burned/ruined tables, chairs, or décor. If damages exceed the<br/>deposit amount, the client is responsible for the full cost of repairs or<br/>replacement.<br/>-Additional Policies<br/>-All clients must sign an event contract prior to the event. Access to the venue will<br/>not be granted without a signed contract.<br/>-Do not remove, disable, or tamper with smoke or carbon monoxide detectors.<br/>-Clients are responsible for the actions of their guests and invitees.<br/>-Any damages or breakages must be reported immediately.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_m3JdJx": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the capacity of the event space?",
            "content": "<p>The downtown Provo event space comfortably accommodates up to 100–150 guests. If you’re unsure whether the space will suit your event, we encourage you to schedule a tour.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_VPKAc4": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How large is the space?",
            "content": "<p>The main event space offers 2,220 square feet in our historic Center Street building, suited for intimate dinners, weddings, and community events in Provo. Guests also have access to an open four-stall restroom and a private mother’s room.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_rByptH": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "When can setup and takedown occur?",
            "content": "<p>All setup and takedown must take place within your scheduled rental time. If you’d like additional support or want to save time, please visit our Add-Ons page for staff assistance<br/>options.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_wDfDxx": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you allow outside vendors for catering?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. While we offer a list of preferred vendors we highly recommend, you are welcome to bring in any licensed vendors of your choice.</p><p>Yes. You are welcome to bring in any licensed vendors of your choice for your event. While we do not require the use of specific vendors, we’ve compiled a list of professionals we’ve worked with and trust. These vendors are familiar with our space and consistently provide excellent service.<br/>We’re happy to share their information as a resource to help make your planning process easier.</p><ul><li><strong>Guru’s Cafe</strong> - catering@guruscafe.com<br/>A longtime local favorite in downtown Provo, Guru’s is known for its flavorful, globally inspired menu and fresh ingredients. Their diverse offerings make it easy to accommodate a wide range of tastes and dietary preferences, and their team is experienced, reliable, and great to work with. If you’re looking for a catering option that’s both crowd-pleasing and uniquely local, Guru’s is an excellent choice.</li><li><strong>Rockwell Ice Cream - </strong>events@rockwellicecream.com<br/>We’re proud to feature Rockwell Ice Cream as one of our preferred vendors. Known for their handcrafted, small-batch ice cream and creative, crowd-pleasing flavors, Rockwell brings a fun and memorable touch to any event. Their commitment to quality ingredients<br/>and exceptional service makes them a favorite for weddings, corporate gatherings, and celebrations of all kinds. Whether served from a charming cart or as part of a custom dessert experience, Rockwell Ice Cream is always a sweet highlight for our guests</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "content_kkaUMe": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is the venue wheelchair accessible?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Our venue is wheelchair accessible, with ramps located throughout the event space.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_fi7PVm": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is there parking available for guests?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. We offer 20+ on-site parking spaces at 241 W Center St in Provo, as well as street parking and a nearby parking garage.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
